      "content": "it doesnt even matter if i rest. i feel like i've tried everything. i sleep, i take breaks, i try to distract myself... but i just wake up feeling exactly the same. it's like the battery is just broken. no matter how much i charge it, it wont hold a charge anymore. i just feel so fundamentally done.",
