    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if a doctor can even fix this. it feels deeper than that. it feels like i'm just... finished. like my purpose is done. i look at people living their lives and i just feel so disconnected. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace from this noise in my head is to just stop everything. does that even make sense?",
