      "content": "The depth of that disconnection and the voice telling you that you are \"finished\" is a common and terrifying symptom of severe depression, even if traditional treatments might not fix everything overnight. While a doctor may not be able to \"fix\" a shattered sense of purpose in the way you imagine, they can provide the tools and support to help you rebuild it piece by piece. Please consider speaking to a mental health professional, as they are trained to navigate exactly these kinds of deep feelings so you don't have to face them in silence.",
